@startuml
title Ingesterator process flow
'skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

' Define Participants
actor User
participant "Nada CLI" as NadaCLI
participant "Nais Postgres" as Postgres
participant "Nais DNS" as NaisDNS
participant "Ingesterator" as Ingesterator
participant "Debezium Operator" as DebeziumOperator
participant "Kubernetes" as Panda
participant Debezium
participant Kafka

User -> NadaCLI: Run "nada ingest enable"
NadaCLI -> Postgres: Configure server parameters
NadaCLI -> Postgres: Add replication user role
NadaCLI -> Postgres: Add schema and heartbeat table
NadaCLI -> Ingesterator: Request replication setup

note right
Postgres instance qualifier
and replication user credentials
end note

Ingesterator -> Panda: Generate Secret
Panda --> Ingesterator
Ingesterator -> Panda: Generate Ingest
Panda --> Ingesterator
Ingesterator --> NadaCLI: Success
NadaCLI --> User: Success

loop Kubernetes operators
    Panda -> Ingesterator: Updates to Ingest resource
    Ingesterator -> NaisDNS: Lookup Postgres pod IPs
    NaisDNS --> Ingesterator: Return DNS record
    Ingesterator -> Panda: Generate DebeziumServer
    Panda -> DebeziumOperator: Refresh
    DebeziumOperator -> Panda: Create Debezium deployment
    Panda -> Debezium: Provision and start
end

loop Continuous Data Capture
    Debezium -> Postgres: WAL replication data stream through direct TCP connection
    Postgres --> Debezium:
    loop Stream to Kafka
        Debezium -> Debezium: Encode row change as message
        Debezium -> Kafka: Produce message
    end
end

@enduml